-- Imports each clinician's most recent performance review from the
-- "2026 Adjust Performance Reviews" Google Sheet as a COMPLETED historical
-- review record, so Review History / Edit Last / Refresh all have real
-- prior data to compare against instead of starting from nothing.
--
-- Deliberately does NOT import the sheet's old numeric KPI/KPA scorecards
-- (kpi_rollups/kpa_rollups stay empty) -- those numbers are stale, hard to
-- map cleanly onto this app's exact field keys, and the app now computes
-- real rollups live from provider_weekly history going forward anyway.
-- What's imported is the narrative continuity: what they were assessed on
-- last time (goals_reflection), what they were proud of, areas for growth,
-- and the goals set at that review (new_goals) -- exactly what "compare
-- against last" needs.
--
-- Reviewer is left blank for all -- no reviewer name was recorded in the
-- sheet for any tab.
--
-- Imogen O'Neill and Riley Fairhurst's tabs never stated a review date
-- (first/6-month reviews, tagged "[6MTHS]" only) -- estimated as
-- 2026-02-12, the same day as the nearest other reviews in this round.
-- Correct via Edit Last on the Reviews page if that's wrong; everything
-- here is editable after import same as any other review.
--
-- 3 admin/front-desk tabs (Edi Henderson, Emily Cecil, Koreena Nesbitt)
-- were also found in the sheet but are NOT included here -- ask if you
-- want those imported too (Emily Cecil's provider record needs confirming
-- first, not seen in a quick check of current providers).

insert into performance_reviews (provider_id, review_date, reviewer, goals_reflection, proud_of, areas_for_growth, new_goals, kpi_rollups, kpa_rollups, bonus_summary, completed_at)
values
